<h2 id="entries">Inspect every mapping</h2>

Open a registry to see its source-derived count and every entry. The native identifiers are technical references, and the linked pattern and example give the household wording. “Not asserted” means this inventory makes no claim that the entry was tested. It does not mean the entry is untested elsewhere.

<% inventory['categories'].each do |category| %>
<details class="govuk-details" id="registry-<%= category['id'] %>">
  <summary class="govuk-details__summary"><span class="govuk-details__summary-text"><%= category['label'] %> — <%= category['count'] %> entries</span></summary>
  <div class="govuk-details__text">
    <p class="govuk-body"><%= category['extraction'] %></p>
    <table class="govuk-table">
      <caption class="govuk-table__caption govuk-table__caption--m"><%= category['label'] %> mappings</caption>
      <thead class="govuk-table__head"><tr class="govuk-table__row"><th class="govuk-table__header" scope="col">Native entry</th><th class="govuk-table__header" scope="col">Design ownership</th><th class="govuk-table__header" scope="col">Example and evidence</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody class="govuk-table__body">
      <% inventory['entries'].select { |entry| entry['category'] == category['id'] }.each do |entry| %>
        <tr class="govuk-table__row" id="coverage-<%= entry['id'].gsub(/[^a-zA-Z0-9_-]/, '-') %>">
          <th class="govuk-table__header" scope="row"><%= entry['native_id'] %><p class="govuk-body-s"><%= entry['availability'].tr('_', ' ') %></p><% if entry['source_members'] %><details><summary>Inspect <%= entry['source_members'].length %> source members</summary><ul class="govuk-list"><% entry['source_members'].each do |member| %><li><a class="govuk-link" href="https://github.com/home-assistant/frontend/blob/<%= inventory['baseline']['frontend_sha'] %>/<%= member %>"><%= member.split('/').last %></a></li><% end %></ul></details><% end %></th>
          <td class="govuk-table__cell"><ul class="govuk-list"><li><a class="govuk-link" href="..<%= entry['guide'] %>">Task pattern: <%= entry['guide'].split('/').last.split('.html').first.tr('-', ' ') %></a></li><li><a class="govuk-link" href="..<%= entry['component'] %>">Component: <%= entry['component'].split('/').last.split('.html').first.tr('-', ' ') %></a></li><li><a class="govuk-link" href="..<%= entry['style'] %>">Style: <%= entry['style'].split('/').last.split('.html').first.tr('-', ' ') %></a></li></ul></td>
          <td class="govuk-table__cell"><ul class="govuk-list"><% entry['examples'].each do |example_id| %><li><a class="govuk-link" href="../examples/<%= example_id %>.html"><%= escape(config[:civica_examples].fetch(example_id).fetch('title')) %></a></li><% end %></ul><p class="govuk-body-s">Native verification: not asserted by this inventory.</p><% if entry['style_variants'] && !entry['style_variants'].empty? %><p class="govuk-body-s">Style variants: <%= entry['style_variants'].join(', ') %>.</p><% end %></td>
